<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_handed__coordinate__space_8hpp">glm/gtx/handed_coordinate_space.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

<para>To know if a set of three basis vectors defines a right or left-handed coordinate system.</para>
</section>
